{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/15aa83576bdd6771977fc9b91efbfdd3.webp?t=1772100466\" width=208 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Card Fusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dala and the Cursed Forest is a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder built around transformation through fusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards to generate Cells, unlock new forms, and redefine your entire build mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fusion decision alters your strategy,\u00a0 shaping your playstyle, strengths, and risks in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just deckbuilding.<br>This is evolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transform Mid-Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather matching Cells to awaken powerful forms, each granting new abilities, unique cards, and distinct combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformation is not a bonus. It reshapes your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your fusion path, experiment with build-defining synergies, and discover how each form changes the way you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/6501c9136d0991af90f6611eb8594e5e.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=234 /></span><strong>Strategic, Ever-Changing Runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys through the cursed forest are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct starting decks.<br>Discover new cards and items.<br>Encounter mysterious events that bless...\u00a0 or twist your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cursed Forest Inspired by Myth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythical creatures and corrupted spirits drawn from dark folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture, the more the forest pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eat. Prepare. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a feline-run restaurant and enjoy Thai-inspired dishes before your next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each meal grants powerful buffs that support your fusion strategy and prepare you for the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Uncover the Truth Behind the Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, new story chapters and memories are unlocked.<br>Piece together the fate of the cursed forest and discover the truth behind Dala\u2019s endless cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run brings you closer to understanding the power that binds her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/2a139b076e52925e07ff31cda19dcf05.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=268 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Fusion system that reshapes Dala\u2019s form and redefines your build mid-run</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful transformations with unique abilities and evolving combat styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple starting decks with distinct fusion paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ cards, including powerful combined forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ items and relics to expand your strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ unique combat encounters with varied enemy patterns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30+ mysterious events and mini-games that alter your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ skills in Dala\u2019s talent tree for long-term progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A handcrafted dark fantasy world with striking art inspired by myth</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748770?t=1772100466","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2748770?t=1772100466","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/2dae724e8a4bd18ffb8852b322805fe5f21ac701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772100466","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/2dae724e8a4bd18ffb8852b322805fe5f21ac701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772100466","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2987220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/15aa83576bdd6771977fc9b91efbfdd3.webp?t=1772100466\" width=208 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/8041e9783bf0933f27432f0e525bddcf.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Card Fusion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dala and the Cursed Forest is a dark fantasy roguelike deckbuilder built around transformation through fusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine cards to generate Cells, unlock new forms, and redefine your entire build mid-run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/a23fcbfbb93d9b233e993a18f45776e2.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fusion decision alters your strategy,\u00a0 shaping your playstyle, strengths, and risks in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just deckbuilding.<br>This is evolution.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Transform Mid-Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather matching Cells to awaken powerful forms, each granting new abilities, unique cards, and distinct combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transformation is not a bonus. It reshapes your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your fusion path, experiment with build-defining synergies, and discover how each form changes the way you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/6501c9136d0991af90f6611eb8594e5e.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=234 /></span><strong>Strategic, Ever-Changing Runs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys through the cursed forest are alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct starting decks.<br>Discover new cards and items.<br>Encounter mysterious events that bless...\u00a0 or twist your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice carries weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Cursed Forest Inspired by Myth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mythical creatures and corrupted spirits drawn from dark folklore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you venture, the more the forest pushes back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.poster.avif?t=1772100466\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.webm?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/94f0f08a8474d4b7641b8682664569fc.mp4?t=1772100466\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Eat. Prepare. Survive.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit a feline-run restaurant and enjoy Thai-inspired dishes before your next battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each meal grants powerful buffs that support your fusion strategy and prepare you for the challenges ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>Uncover the Truth Behind the Curse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, new story chapters and memories are unlocked.<br>Piece together the fate of the cursed forest and discover the truth behind Dala\u2019s endless cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run brings you closer to understanding the power that binds her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2748770/extras/2a139b076e52925e07ff